<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Noah's World, a personal collection of stories, photographs, travels, and memories.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About this place</p>
    <h1>The world as seen through my eyes.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Noah's World began as a way to share photographs and videos from life's adventures with family and friends.</p>
    <p>The original site was built with Apple's iWeb and published in 2010. This new edition preserves those stories while making them easier to enjoy on today's phones, tablets, and computers.</p>
    <p>It remains what it has always been: a personal collection of travels, projects, celebrations, and memories worth keeping.</p>
    <p>Some family photographs live in a private area for invited family and friends.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="/journal/">Browse the journal</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
